h powerful psychokinetic abilities who escapes a secret government lab, strongly echoes the psychic espers (especially Akira himself) from the film."},{"source":"work_aw15","target":"work_aw32","type":"work_work","relation_type":"influenced","relation_note":"The film's plot, which follows a troubled teenager who gains telekinetic powers and loses control, directly mirrors Tetsuo's character arc and the destructive consequences of unchecked power."},{"source":"work_aw15","target":"work_aw15","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"The film is a direct adaptation by the original creator of his own epic manga series, though it condenses the sprawling narrative of the first half."},{"source":"work_aw15","target":"work_aw27","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"The film shares a strong aesthetic lineage with Blade Runner's vision of a futuristic, neon-drenched, multicultural metropolis struggling with urban decay."},{"source":"person_ap7","target":"person_ap117","type":"person_person","relation_type":"influenced_by","relation_note":"Derived: Akira → Blade Runner","confidence":"corroborated"},{"source":"person_ap80","target":"person_ap7","type":"person_person","relation_type":"influenced_by","relation_note":"Derived: Akira → Ghost in the Shell","confidence":"corroborated"},{"source":"person_ap83","target":"person_ap7","type":"person_person","relation_type":"influenced_by","relation_note":"Derived: Akira → The Matrix","confidence":"corroborated"},{"source":"person_ap117","target":"work_aw366","type":"person_work","role_type":"producer","role_detail":"Executive Producer"},{"source":"person_ap117","target":"work_aw75","type":"person_work","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Director"},{"source":"person_ap117","target":"work_aw27","type":"person_work","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Director"},{"source":"person_ap80","target":"work_aw29","type":"person_work","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Director"},{"sourc